# Leave Management

Full feature docs: **`context/leave-management.md`**. Modal keyboard pattern: **`context/modals.md`** (Keyboard-aware bottom sheets).

## Hub routes (`LeaveManagement.tsx`)

| Menu id | Destination |
|---------|-------------|
| `create` | `CreateManagementLeaveModal` (on hub) |
| `requests` | `LeaveRequests` |
| `balances` | `LeaveBalance` |
| `configs` | `LeaveConfig` |

## API summary (`leaveApi.ts`)

| Endpoint | Screen / modal |
|----------|----------------|
| `GET /leave/emp-leaves` | LeaveRequests |
| `PUT /leave/management/approve-edit` | ApproveLeaveModal |
| `PUT /leave/reject` | RejectLeaveModal |
| `PUT /leave/management/bulk-approve-reject` | BulkLeaveActionModal |
| `GET /leave/emp-balances` | LeaveBalance |
| `POST /leave/assign-balance` | AssignLeaveBalanceModal |
| `PUT /leave/update-balance` | UpdateLeaveBalanceModal |
| `DELETE /leave/delete-balance` | LeaveBalance |
| `GET /leave/company` | LeaveConfig list + config hooks |
| `POST /leave/create` | LeaveConfigFormModal (create) |
| `PUT /leave/update` | LeaveConfigFormModal (edit) |
| `DELETE /leave/delete` | LeaveConfig |

All company-scoped calls use `company: String(companyId)` header.

## Bottom-sheet modals with inputs

Use **keyboard listeners only** — no `KeyboardAvoidingView` + listeners stack.

```tsx
scroll: { flexGrow: 0, flexShrink: 1 },
scrollKeyboardOpen: { flex: 1, minHeight: 0 },

<ScrollView
  style={[styles.scroll, keyboardHeight > 0 && styles.scrollKeyboardOpen]}
/>
```

Canonical reference: **`LeaveConfigFormModal.tsx`**.

## Leave config create defaults

- `allow_half_day`: **false**
- `is_paid`: true
- `exclude_weekends`: true
- `carry_forward_limit`: 0

## Day formatting

Always use **`formatLeaveDays`** / **`coerceLeaveDays`** — API may return numeric strings.

## Confirm / status

Mutations: **`ConfirmAlert`** before submit → **`StatusAlert`** on result. Refetch list on success.
